1
00:00:00,750 --> 00:00:05,270
Soon, you'll lose all your power.

2
00:00:05,700 --> 00:00:14,790
Once you lose the power you were granted, 
you'll realize you're nothing at all.

3
00:00:15,940 --> 00:00:17,070
Sooha...

4
00:00:32,030 --> 00:00:35,010
- The Moon Altar -

5
00:00:44,640 --> 00:00:45,960
Damn you!

6
00:00:55,740 --> 00:00:56,410
Sooha!

7
00:00:57,010 --> 00:01:00,180
Sooha, wake up! Sooha!

8
00:01:01,540 --> 00:01:03,620
We need to get out of here.

9
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:14,100
We can't leave.

10
00:01:15,470 --> 00:01:19,980
<i>Is this light the unsealed royal power?</i>

11
00:01:20,380 --> 00:01:21,990
<i>And that's trapping her in here?</i>

12
00:01:23,250 --> 00:01:24,500
Sooha...

13
00:01:27,480 --> 00:01:31,860
There's something I haven't told you yet.

14
00:01:32,600 --> 00:01:38,030
That night, I was scared 
to death to bite your neck.

15
00:01:38,780 --> 00:01:42,040
I didn't know what I'd do if I hurt you.

16
00:01:43,040 --> 00:01:50,880
But more than that, I was 
happy to learn you trusted me.

17
00:01:51,790 --> 00:01:59,760
So I promise I'll repay your trust 
by getting you out of here now.

18
00:02:00,630 --> 00:02:01,510
Heli.

19
00:02:03,470 --> 00:02:04,570
Sooha?

20
00:02:06,470 --> 00:02:11,450
Heli, you... you came to my rescue again.

21
00:02:12,180 --> 00:02:17,560
Both then and now, you're always...

22
00:02:19,560 --> 00:02:20,990
You're always...

23
00:02:21,530 --> 00:02:22,410
Yeah.

24
00:02:30,070 --> 00:02:31,040
Heli!

25
00:02:34,330 --> 00:02:38,550
Both then and now, 
you're always getting in my way!

26
00:02:38,930 --> 00:02:45,460
If it weren't for you, 
the princess would've chosen me!

27
00:02:45,460 --> 00:02:46,560
Heli!

28
00:02:46,780 --> 00:02:49,140
At least, she would have in this life!

29
00:02:52,210 --> 00:02:54,150
Stop!

30
00:02:57,660 --> 00:03:01,070
Heli, hang in there! Get up!

31
00:03:02,160 --> 00:03:03,820
Why? I can't get out!

32
00:03:03,820 --> 00:03:05,910
Heli, hang in there!

33
00:03:11,420 --> 00:03:12,600
Your Highness.

34
00:03:13,460 --> 00:03:16,380
It's all over now.

35
00:03:17,630 --> 00:03:22,910
Everyone who came to
 save you is out of strength.

36
00:03:23,650 --> 00:03:28,010
And I've still got plenty of underlings.

37
00:03:28,860 --> 00:03:33,260
The power you granted 
them has returned, too.

38
00:03:34,410 --> 00:03:39,900
In the end, all of it will be mine.

39
00:03:40,340 --> 00:03:46,410
Everything will be taken from you, 
and you will be mine forever.

40
00:03:55,330 --> 00:03:56,590
Dardan!

41
00:04:05,140 --> 00:04:07,250
<i>I have no strength left...</i>

42
00:04:08,640 --> 00:04:12,390
<i>Sooha, I have to protect you.</i>

43
00:04:13,540 --> 00:04:16,780
<i>You healed our wounds.</i>

44
00:04:17,590 --> 00:04:20,310
<i>You shared your power with us, too.</i>

45
00:04:21,560 --> 00:04:25,910
<i>So why can't I do anything for you now?</i>

46
00:04:26,950 --> 00:04:32,580
<i>Without the power you 
granted me, I'm useless.</i>

47
00:04:37,880 --> 00:04:40,200
Don't waste your time.

48
00:04:41,130 --> 00:04:47,020
Will you flee and be reincarnated 
again? Just try it.

49
00:04:47,020 --> 00:04:52,600
No matter how long it takes or 
where you hide, I will find you.

50
00:04:56,870 --> 00:04:59,570
Haven't you ever thought it was strange?

51
00:05:00,150 --> 00:05:04,660
Why were you always suspected 
of being a vampire?

52
00:05:05,160 --> 00:05:09,660
Why were the people around you 
always attacked by vampires?

53
00:05:10,900 --> 00:05:12,660
You know, Sooha...

54
00:05:12,660 --> 00:05:16,900
Chris died because of you.

55
00:05:18,050 --> 00:05:22,190
Because you cared for him 
more than anyone else,

56
00:05:22,190 --> 00:05:27,130
I planned everything so 
I could take his spot.

57
00:05:32,470 --> 00:05:35,270
You understand me now, don't you?

58
00:05:35,270 --> 00:05:42,060
Even if you escape me now, you'll just 
meet the same fate in your next life.

59
00:05:43,650 --> 00:05:45,110
Dardan!

60
00:05:47,650 --> 00:05:50,280
It's too late.

61
00:05:52,530 --> 00:05:56,390
You used the last of your power.

62
00:05:56,390 --> 00:06:01,030
You still don't know 
how to use it properly.

63
00:06:01,030 --> 00:06:04,010
You don't deserve it.

64
00:06:04,010 --> 00:06:07,430
That's why I'll take it from you.

65
00:06:09,420 --> 00:06:12,990
I know I can use it far better than you.

66
00:06:13,720 --> 00:06:16,170
Rest for a while.

67
00:06:16,170 --> 00:06:19,730
I'll end this in the meantime.

68
00:06:25,940 --> 00:06:29,940
<i>My power should be gone, so why?</i>

69
00:06:32,160 --> 00:06:34,140
<i>I'd been keeping it secret.</i>

70
00:06:35,210 --> 00:06:41,630
<i>I hid that both vampire and 
werewolf blood flowed in my veins.</i>

71
00:06:42,430 --> 00:06:47,640
<i>But even after I admitted it, 
they're still my friends.</i>

72
00:06:49,170 --> 00:06:56,430
<i>This power was meant to be used 
to save both them and Sooha, but...</i>

73
00:06:56,690 --> 00:07:01,240
<i>I wasn't happy when I first 
realized I had this power</i>

74
00:07:02,060 --> 00:07:06,380
<i>because I didn't understand why I had it.</i>

75
00:07:07,300 --> 00:07:13,000
<i>Now I understand that it's not for 
hurting others, but for protecting them.</i>

76
00:07:13,750 --> 00:07:17,790
<i>So why can't I use it?</i>

77
00:07:18,020 --> 00:07:22,110
<i>Normally, I'd be able to 
get up there in an instant.</i>

78
00:07:22,900 --> 00:07:26,300
<i>Will I never move like that again?</i>

79
00:07:27,090 --> 00:07:28,870
<i>I have to save Sooha.</i>

80
00:07:29,270 --> 00:07:33,260
<i>I can't believe I'm powerless 
in this critical moment.</i>

81
00:07:33,580 --> 00:07:37,400
<i>Damn him. Damn him.</i>

82
00:07:37,760 --> 00:07:41,020
<i>Damn him for doing this to Sooha.</i>

83
00:07:41,020 --> 00:07:43,770
<i>I wish I could hit him as hard as I can.</i>

84
00:07:44,300 --> 00:07:45,520
<i>But...</i>

85
00:07:45,520 --> 00:07:48,530
<i>Damn, damn, damn!</i>

86
00:07:48,840 --> 00:07:50,360
<i>I hate this.</i>

87
00:07:51,350 --> 00:07:54,340
<i>I don't want to lose anyone I care about.</i>

88
00:07:55,640 --> 00:07:59,580
<i>I need to protect them, so why can't I?</i>

89
00:08:15,560 --> 00:08:19,090
<i>I was afraid of the dark
 when I was little.</i>

90
00:08:19,830 --> 00:08:23,890
<i>But at some point,
 I stopped feeling that way.</i>

91
00:08:30,620 --> 00:08:32,440
<i>The darkness is my domain.</i>

92
00:08:33,100 --> 00:08:35,510
<i>Shadows are a part of me.</i>

93
00:08:37,180 --> 00:08:39,290
<i>I have to save the others.</i>

94
00:08:42,060 --> 00:08:46,020
- Dark Moon: The Blood Altar -

95
00:08:46,060 --> 00:08:50,000
- Dark Moon: The Blood Altar -

96
00:08:53,750 --> 00:08:54,470
<i>Heli!</i>

97
00:09:05,540 --> 00:09:07,370
I'm so close!

98
00:09:08,270 --> 00:09:11,280
I'm so close to the end!

99
00:09:13,810 --> 00:09:16,300
Heli, are you okay? Heli!

100
00:09:17,560 --> 00:09:20,870
Noa, how did you use your power?

101
00:09:20,870 --> 00:09:22,700
I'm not sure myself.

102
00:09:23,480 --> 00:09:25,350
I thought I couldn't use it anymore.

103
00:09:25,980 --> 00:09:31,870
But for some reason, I felt 
like I'd always had this power.

104
00:09:32,650 --> 00:09:33,260
No, wait.

105
00:09:34,350 --> 00:09:36,050
I know I sensed it.

106
00:09:36,410 --> 00:09:38,930
I wasn't granted this power by Sooha.

107
00:09:39,970 --> 00:09:41,390
That's it.

108
00:09:41,750 --> 00:09:46,030
Remember what Marge said? 
That we're vampire lords.

109
00:09:46,030 --> 00:09:46,940
Yeah.

110
00:09:47,220 --> 00:09:50,270
Our crests haven't 
disappeared, which means...

111
00:09:50,270 --> 00:09:54,600
we still have our powers that awakened 
after we became vampire lords.

112
00:09:54,930 --> 00:09:59,990
We must've forgotten 
about our true powers.

113
00:09:59,990 --> 00:10:00,950
Yeah.

114
00:10:01,810 --> 00:10:03,000
<i>Remember!</i>

115
00:10:06,600 --> 00:10:07,290
Heli?

116
00:10:09,880 --> 00:10:12,250
Heli regained his power.

117
00:10:12,700 --> 00:10:14,960
<i>Guys, listen to me.</i>

118
00:10:14,960 --> 00:10:18,630
<i>We all have powers we've always had.</i>

119
00:10:19,140 --> 00:10:22,130
<i>Remember that.</i>

120
00:10:34,230 --> 00:10:38,280
Now I will be king!

121
00:10:39,900 --> 00:10:41,040
Shion!

122
00:10:41,040 --> 00:10:42,610
Don't let them take her!

123
00:10:43,530 --> 00:10:46,660
Slay your allies!

124
00:10:52,090 --> 00:10:54,040
Marge, are you okay?

125
00:10:54,040 --> 00:10:55,750
Yes. Thank you.

126
00:10:56,670 --> 00:10:57,780
Sooha!

127
00:10:57,780 --> 00:10:59,930
This ends now!

128
00:11:04,730 --> 00:11:07,400
How have your powers returned?!

129
00:11:07,400 --> 00:11:10,520
Damn you, werewolf!

130
00:11:24,520 --> 00:11:27,650
Enough...

131
00:11:27,650 --> 00:11:28,370
What?

132
00:11:29,870 --> 00:11:32,370
Enough.

133
00:11:34,070 --> 00:11:35,350
I...

134
00:11:37,390 --> 00:11:39,420
I'll end this.

135
00:11:47,970 --> 00:11:49,140
Jaan!

136
00:11:57,150 --> 00:11:59,750
I don't need any of it anymore.

137
00:12:00,150 --> 00:12:04,160
Not the princess's power, 
nor the princess herself.

138
00:12:04,910 --> 00:12:08,060
If I can't live with the princess,

139
00:12:09,310 --> 00:12:13,660
then I don't mind dying with her.

140
00:12:18,980 --> 00:12:19,960
What is he doing?

141
00:12:20,510 --> 00:12:21,630
Sooha!

142
00:12:44,360 --> 00:12:49,930
Your Highness, I'll be 
with you at the end.

143
00:12:52,520 --> 00:12:55,370
That's right. Before that...

144
00:12:58,190 --> 00:13:00,340
I'll take care of you.

145
00:13:28,770 --> 00:13:33,420
Sooha, why again?

146
00:13:37,950 --> 00:13:40,230
Sooha! Sooha!

147
00:13:43,330 --> 00:13:46,970
I know. We'll just do it again.

148
00:13:47,970 --> 00:13:50,930
You'll be reborn, and we'll meet again!

149
00:13:51,650 --> 00:13:56,660
No matter how many millennia 
it takes, I'll find you!

150
00:13:57,190 --> 00:13:59,460
I swear I'll look for you!

151
00:14:01,190 --> 00:14:04,030
Heli, I'm sorry.

152
00:14:05,370 --> 00:14:08,280
I can't reincarnate again.

153
00:14:08,860 --> 00:14:12,950
This is the end of my life.

154
00:14:15,420 --> 00:14:23,560
Meeting all of you in this life,

155
00:14:23,560 --> 00:14:28,310
befriending you,
 and spending our time together...

156
00:14:29,750 --> 00:14:32,210
It made me so happy.

157
00:14:33,110 --> 00:14:36,060
So it's okay.

158
00:14:40,020 --> 00:14:45,780
Since this is the end,
 I won't hide anything anymore.

159
00:14:47,140 --> 00:14:50,320
I love you, Heli.

160
00:14:52,770 --> 00:14:56,340
I love you too, Sooha.

161
00:14:59,830 --> 00:15:00,850
Heli.

162
00:15:02,210 --> 00:15:10,750
In both the present and the past, you've 
been the greatest knight of my life.

163
00:15:12,010 --> 00:15:18,100
Your Highness, I will always 
be your knight, and yours alone.

164
00:16:04,010 --> 00:16:07,190
So this is the princess's power.

165
00:16:08,470 --> 00:16:11,190
You don't know how to use it properly!

166
00:16:15,650 --> 00:16:17,090
Damn it...

167
00:16:19,300 --> 00:16:25,650
Dardan, now that I've regained all 
my power, I cannot forgive you.

168
00:16:26,950 --> 00:16:31,300
Your crimes are far too great.

169
00:16:32,250 --> 00:16:40,310
Your Highness, all I wanted was your love.

170
00:16:41,350 --> 00:16:46,000
Do you know how hard I, 
a man of low status, had to work

171
00:16:46,000 --> 00:16:48,030
to climb to the chancellor's seat?

172
00:16:48,030 --> 00:16:52,200
I did it all for your love.

173
00:16:53,230 --> 00:16:56,530
If only you'd loved me!

174
00:16:56,990 --> 00:17:00,780
Then I never would've done any of this!

175
00:17:02,860 --> 00:17:04,250
I told you.

176
00:17:04,910 --> 00:17:08,750
Only a citizen who's sincerely 
pledged their loyalty

177
00:17:09,330 --> 00:17:11,870
can inherit the royal power.

178
00:17:13,590 --> 00:17:20,430
It can never be claimed by those 
who try to take it by force.

179
00:17:21,070 --> 00:17:22,570
Love is the same.

180
00:17:23,830 --> 00:17:25,420
I knew.

181
00:17:26,270 --> 00:17:30,270
I knew my love wouldn't 
go the way I wanted.

182
00:17:30,930 --> 00:17:35,780
<i>Despite knowing your heart 
wasn't mine from the start...</i>

183
00:17:36,230 --> 00:17:38,530
<i>No, because I learned that...</i>

184
00:17:39,450 --> 00:17:42,290
<i>I used status as an excuse.</i>

185
00:17:43,160 --> 00:17:47,290
<i>Despite knowing that, 
no matter how hard I tried,</i>

186
00:17:47,950 --> 00:17:53,840
<i>I simply couldn't change 
how I felt about you.</i>

187
00:17:55,380 --> 00:18:03,150
Selen, you will always be my...

188
00:18:40,610 --> 00:18:41,780
Your Highness...

189
00:18:42,490 --> 00:18:44,930
No, you're a queen now, Your Majesty.

190
00:18:45,500 --> 00:18:49,490
Please, just call me Sooha.

191
00:18:49,490 --> 00:18:50,310
But...

192
00:18:50,630 --> 00:18:55,320
Allow me to formally 
thank you for finding them.

193
00:18:56,900 --> 00:18:59,410
I simply did what I had to do.

194
00:18:59,950 --> 00:19:02,950
Guys, thanks for coming to save me.

195
00:19:10,960 --> 00:19:14,460
What will you do now?

196
00:19:15,660 --> 00:19:19,260
Both the kingdom and Dardan are gone now.

197
00:19:20,020 --> 00:19:23,660
I think I'd like to live 
my own life in the present.

198
00:19:26,970 --> 00:19:28,620
I have good news.

199
00:19:29,470 --> 00:19:33,090
A new dorm room has opened up.
 You can move into it.

200
00:19:33,860 --> 00:19:37,190
Really? Thank you.

201
00:19:37,750 --> 00:19:40,890
It must've been tough 
living in that old room.

202
00:19:40,890 --> 00:19:44,820
The new rooms are shared, 
so be nice to your roommates.

203
00:19:44,820 --> 00:19:46,700
Roommates...

204
00:19:50,230 --> 00:19:51,060
You...

205
00:19:51,060 --> 00:19:53,460
Uh, um...

206
00:19:54,860 --> 00:19:57,220
You're so strong!

207
00:19:58,380 --> 00:20:02,050
I-I just thought I'd clean under the bed.

208
00:20:02,300 --> 00:20:03,270
I'll help.

209
00:20:03,270 --> 00:20:04,730
Hup.

210
00:20:04,730 --> 00:20:06,680
Oh, right. The screw on this bedâ€”

211
00:20:06,680 --> 00:20:07,640
Sooha.

212
00:20:09,100 --> 00:20:09,810
Heli!

213
00:20:10,430 --> 00:20:11,630
Guys!

214
00:20:12,200 --> 00:20:13,690
We came to help.

215
00:20:13,690 --> 00:20:18,360
Thanks for coming, but there 
isn't that much to do.

216
00:20:18,360 --> 00:20:20,460
I know. Shall we have some tea?

217
00:20:20,460 --> 00:20:22,130
Yes, let's.

218
00:20:22,130 --> 00:20:24,070
If you insist.

219
00:20:26,910 --> 00:20:29,450
Happy birthday, Khan!

220
00:20:29,450 --> 00:20:30,690
Here, for you!

221
00:20:30,690 --> 00:20:31,650
Thanks.

222
00:20:31,650 --> 00:20:34,010
Sooha, you came!

223
00:20:34,010 --> 00:20:35,560
Have fun today.

224
00:20:35,560 --> 00:20:36,330
Okay!

225
00:20:36,330 --> 00:20:39,240
Ugh, how am I supposed to have fun?

226
00:20:39,240 --> 00:20:42,220
I just got here, and I'm already bored.

227
00:20:42,220 --> 00:20:46,140
Sooha, we don't have 
time for this. Let's go.

228
00:20:46,140 --> 00:20:48,510
We only invited Sooha!

229
00:20:48,510 --> 00:20:50,640
What are you guys doing here?!

230
00:20:50,640 --> 00:20:54,190
Well, you guys ruined our birthday party!

231
00:20:54,190 --> 00:20:56,190
Just leave your presents and go!

232
00:20:56,190 --> 00:20:58,220
You just want the presents!

233
00:20:58,220 --> 00:21:00,130
Khan will appreciate them!

234
00:21:00,130 --> 00:21:02,760
Thanks for inviting me today.

235
00:21:02,760 --> 00:21:04,400
I'm glad you came.

236
00:21:06,040 --> 00:21:07,930
Are you and Heli getting along?

237
00:21:09,580 --> 00:21:10,310
Yeah.

238
00:21:12,830 --> 00:21:15,410
Sooha, like I told you before,

239
00:21:15,410 --> 00:21:20,630
werewolves love whoever we see 
during an eclipse for life.

240
00:21:20,950 --> 00:21:24,510
So I'll love you forever, too.

241
00:21:27,430 --> 00:21:28,830
But that's not all.

242
00:21:29,460 --> 00:21:31,080
I really do like you.

243
00:21:31,750 --> 00:21:35,430
I'm glad you were the one 
I ran into that night.

244
00:21:35,980 --> 00:21:40,270
I want you to be happy.

245
00:21:44,760 --> 00:21:46,280
Thanks, Khan.

246
00:21:46,610 --> 00:21:48,530
So you're the great Sooha.

247
00:21:48,530 --> 00:21:51,020
My name is Luca.

248
00:21:51,020 --> 00:21:52,700
It's an honor to meet you.

249
00:21:54,900 --> 00:21:56,580
Forgive my brother.

250
00:21:56,910 --> 00:21:59,500
I am Louis, the younger twin.

251
00:21:59,500 --> 00:22:02,170
Luca, Louis! When'd you get here?

252
00:22:02,550 --> 00:22:04,310
Sorry we're late.

253
00:22:04,310 --> 00:22:06,240
Excuse us, Your Majesty.

254
00:22:06,240 --> 00:22:10,680
From now on, we shall stand by your 
side and protect you, Your Majesty.

255
00:22:10,910 --> 00:22:15,640
Oh, uh, I'm not a queen anymore.
 I'm just a high school student.

256
00:22:18,560 --> 00:22:19,710
Cheers!

257
00:22:27,380 --> 00:22:30,440
It's so dark. Give us a light, Jino.

258
00:22:30,440 --> 00:22:32,450
I'm not a flashlight.

259
00:22:32,450 --> 00:22:36,120
Hey, when's the last time 
you guys used your powers?

260
00:22:36,610 --> 00:22:38,790
When I roasted marshmallows for Sooha.

261
00:22:38,790 --> 00:22:41,210
During nightball practice?

262
00:22:41,210 --> 00:22:46,050
To catch the ball Jaan threw outside 
the academy with his monstrous strength.

263
00:22:46,050 --> 00:22:48,090
To make a crab silhouette.

264
00:22:48,340 --> 00:22:51,100
None of that sounds very useful.

265
00:22:51,100 --> 00:22:52,970
What about you, then?

266
00:22:53,320 --> 00:22:57,480
When I made the art club 
draw portraits of me.

267
00:22:57,480 --> 00:22:59,840
Don't use it for that!

268
00:22:59,840 --> 00:23:01,870
I haven't used mine at all since then.

269
00:23:01,870 --> 00:23:05,630
Yeah, 'cause you can't 
do anything fun as a wolf.

270
00:23:05,630 --> 00:23:10,260
When you put it that way, Heli 
probably uses his telepathy the most.

271
00:23:12,370 --> 00:23:16,200
Were you two just speaking telepathically?

272
00:23:16,200 --> 00:23:17,850
Since when?

273
00:23:17,850 --> 00:23:20,160
What were you talking about?

274
00:23:20,160 --> 00:23:21,940
W-We weren't talking about anything.

275
00:23:21,940 --> 00:23:22,960
Really?

276
00:23:22,960 --> 00:23:24,380
Hey, Heli.

277
00:23:24,380 --> 00:23:26,200
Tell us.

278
00:23:26,530 --> 00:23:27,460
It's a secret.

279
00:23:27,750 --> 00:23:31,410
What? Sooha, your face is bright red.

280
00:23:31,410 --> 00:23:32,170
Huh?!

281
00:23:33,340 --> 00:23:35,730
C'mon, what were you talking about?

